{"id":"580b00b43dcd196a","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-settheoretic-realization.md","title":"Set-Theoretic Realizations","display":"df-settheoretic-realization — Set-Theoretic Realizations","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-settheoretic-realization","aliases":["89-df-settheoretic-realization"],"display":"df-settheoretic-realization — Set-Theoretic Realizations","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-settheoretic-realization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-settheoretic-realization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-settheoretic-realization — Set-Theoretic Realizations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZF}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZF}\\)</span> 是固定的一阶 Zermelo–Fraenkel 公理集（不含选择公理），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}=\\mathrm{ZF}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{AC}\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}=\\mathrm{ZF}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{AC}\\}\\)</span>，其中 AC 是选择公理的固定句子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\in}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\in}\\)</span> 为共同语言句子集。这些为显式外部基础数据。传递模型翻译在 ZF 中，强不可达宇宙翻译在 ZFC 中使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\in}\">\\(r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\in}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_r\">\\(\\tau_r\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>、布尔联结词按结构递归，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_{\\in}\">\\(\\bot_{\\in}\\)</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x(x\\ne x)\">\\(\\exists x(x\\ne x)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Sat}(M,c)\">\\(\\mathsf{Sat}(M,c)\\)</span> 表示集合大小结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 对句子码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 的递归满足关系，ZF 可定义该关系；不使用对整个宇宙的真谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TM}_{\\mathrm{ZF}}(M)\">\\(\\mathsf{TM}_{\\mathrm{ZF}}(M)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 是传递集合且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,\\in\\upharpoonright M)\">\\((M,\\in\\upharpoonright M)\\)</span> 满足每条 ZF 公理；通过可递归公理编码量化。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Univ}(M)\">\\(\\mathsf{Univ}(M)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=V_\\kappa\">\\(M=V_\\kappa\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 为强不可达基数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau^{\\mathrm{tm}}_r,\\tau^{\\mathrm u}_r:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in\">\\(\\tau^{\\mathrm{tm}}_r,\\tau^{\\mathrm u}_r:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in\\)</span> 为下述递归定义的翻译；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tm}\">\\(\\mathrm{tm}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm u\">\\(\\mathrm u\\)</span> 为传递模型和宇宙的角色上标。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}settheoretic\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{tm}}_r(\\Box A)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\forall M\\,(\\mathsf{TM}_{\\mathrm{ZF}}(M)\\to\n\\mathsf{Sat}(M,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau^{\\mathrm{tm}}_r(A)\\urcorner})),\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm u}_r(\\Box A)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\forall M\\,(\\mathsf{Univ}(M)\\to\n\\mathsf{Sat}(M,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau^{\\mathrm u}_r(A)\\urcorner})).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}settheoretic\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{tm}}_r(\\Box A)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\forall M\\,(\\mathsf{TM}_{\\mathrm{ZF}}(M)\\to\n\\mathsf{Sat}(M,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau^{\\mathrm{tm}}_r(A)\\urcorner})),\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm u}_r(\\Box A)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\forall M\\,(\\mathsf{Univ}(M)\\to\n\\mathsf{Sat}(M,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau^{\\mathrm u}_r(A)\\urcorner})).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 13 章，印刷页 165–175；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n量词位于集合论对象语言，码以其自然数的标准定义代入；显示横线是句法编码记法，不把 ZF 语言扩为算术语言。两条递归连同原子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(p)=r(p)\">\\(\\tau(p)=r(p)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(\\bot)=\\bot_\\in\">\\(\\tau(\\bot)=\\bot_\\in\\)</span> 和布尔条款唯一确定句子翻译。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Sat}\">\\(\\mathsf{Sat}\\)</span> 只针对集合模型；原书 p.165 声明：讨论不可达基数时将选择公理纳入其“ZF”，其他部分则不纳入；本目录显式写 ZFC 避免把 J 的基础误写为无选择的 ZF。本条未展开 ZF、AC、秩层及强不可达的基础原子，它们是明示的外部基础，不声称已完成这部分集合论形式化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}=\\mathrm{ZF}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{AC}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\in}","display":false},{"tex":"r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\in}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_r","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_{\\in}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists x(x\\ne x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Sat}(M,c)","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{TM}_{\\mathrm{ZF}}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"(M,\\in\\upharpoonright M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Univ}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"M=V_\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau^{\\mathrm{tm}}_r,\\tau^{\\mathrm u}_r:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}settheoretic\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{tm}}_r(\\Box A)&\\coloneqq\n\\forall M\\,(\\mathsf{TM}_{\\mathrm{ZF}}(M)\\to\n\\mathsf{Sat}(M,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau^{\\mathrm{tm}}_r(A)\\urcorner})),\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm u}_r(\\Box A)&\\coloneqq\n\\forall M\\,(\\mathsf{Univ}(M)\\to\n\\mathsf{Sat}(M,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau^{\\mathrm u}_r(A)\\urcorner})).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau(p)=r(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau(\\bot)=\\bot_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Sat}","display":false}],"bytes":2645,"backlinks":[{"id":"a0adb8444eeba120","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-56","locations":["正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"[[89-df-settheoretic-realization]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-147","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-finite-prewellorder]] → [[89-df-settheoretic-modal-logics]] → [[89-df-settheoretic-realization]] → [[89-thm-settheoretic-completeness]]"}],"outgoing":["56c1b5b75a32ca1d"]}